<tr><td>Epidemiology</td><td>兒童／青少年（postinfectious）；成人（diabetes、paraproteinemia）</td><td>Mid to late adulthood；男女相同</td></tr>
<tr><td>Associated conditions</td><td>Postinfectious、diabetes mellitus、paraproteinemia；also hyperparathyroidism、connective tissue disease、HIV</td><td>Paraproteinemia</td></tr>
